{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2019-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1549584000, "end_date": 1550188799, "month_true_total": 50, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:56:33 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "48996124", "author": {"steamid": "76561198360888484", "personaname": "Ultrasmurf", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198360888484/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 6840, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 657, "last_played": 1725302426, "avatar": "1eb8d095cf5340aacb647cb5869f4a57cf41e8be"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still after all these years Warhammer 40k: Space Marine is true to it's name.\n\nYou are a SPACE MARINE! \n\nYou purge, kill, tear, and destroy any green skins that'll get in your path to victory. Even after a decade the game's combat is rather smooth and easy to get to know. The story is still a wonderful journey towards memory lane; paved with the blood of the enemies of the Imperium. \n\nThe glory kills are still AWESOME (Only able to do such in Story-mode) and with the few different ways to execute makes it just as enjoyable. Still holds up it's glorious golden flag of the Emperor-of-Man-Kind and I recommend it to any loyalists whom want to purge for the Imperium.\n\nOr as well to any traitors whom want to spill blood for the Blood-God and add skulls for the skull throne.", "timestamp_created": 1550186056, "timestamp_updated": 1550186056, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48991092", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999102547", "personaname": "profile", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/noneoftheaboveftg/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 378, "playtime_forever": 1569, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 802, "last_played": 1761611480, "avatar": "9f39d1d1842e916ef38c34a6fc118596350116bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "They put this masterpiece in a mediocre article about allegedly mediocre action games, so I made this review.", "timestamp_created": 1550165530, "timestamp_updated": 1550165530, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48986279", "author": {"steamid": "76561198217390668", "personaname": "Rain4Cats", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198217390668/", "num_games_owned": 56, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 384, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 331, "last_played": 1563814128, "avatar": "42a87396d085834a7561f05499d280672648bc13"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is really good especially if u can catch up with the story.\nGreatly optimised and can play on low-end PC's like mine.\n\n[iGPU] AMD 7300 APU with Radeon HD Graphics 3.80GHz \n4GB of PC RAM", "timestamp_created": 1550147807, "timestamp_updated": 1550147807, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "48974811", "author": {"steamid": "76561198227151192", "personaname": "Романус/IBIZA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/2281337082/", "num_games_owned": 84,